superfile (FULL_VERSION) DIST; urgency=low

  ## v1.6.0 (2026-06-07)

  - Migrate to Bubble Tea v2, which makes image and file previews markedly more
    reliable. ([#1406](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1406))
  - Richer file metadata: binary architecture detection for ELF, PE and Mach-O
    executables, Linux file attributes, and a file type byte in the permissions
    column. ([#1328](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1328))
    ([#1432](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1432))
    ([#1410](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1410))
  - Sidebar sections can be shown, hidden and reordered from the config.
    ([#1323](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1323))
  - New `split_file_panel` key function, plus navigation fixes so returning to a
    parent directory keeps the cursor on the directory you came from.
    ([#1344](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1344))
    ([#1340](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1340))
  - Delete, paste and text-preview failures now report what actually went wrong
    instead of a generic error.
    ([#1408](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1408))
    ([#1431](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1431))
    ([#1436](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1436))
  - New `--debug-info` flag, PostScript file support, and Desktop added to the
    well-known directories.
  - Fixes for invalid themes crashing startup, `natural_sort` being rejected as a
    sort option, multi-column header misalignment, and non-deterministic file
    processing order.
  - New website and logo design.
    ([#1423](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1423))

  ## v1.5.0 (2026-01-13)

  - Video and PDF previews, rendered from the first frame or page.
  - Multi-column file panel with date, size and permission columns.
  - Configurable fast navigation in the file panel.
    ([#1220](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1220))
  - Open files with a per-extension editor of your choice.
    ([#1197](https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/pull/1197))
  - Terminal stdout support for shell commands, and launching with a file name:
    `spf /a/b/c.txt` opens `/a/b` with `c.txt` selected.

  ## v1.4.0 (2025-10-10)

  - Zoxide panel: install zoxide, set `zoxide_support` to `true` in the config,
    and press `z` to jump.
  - File previewing is now asynchronous, so scrolling through images stays
    responsive on slow systems.

  ## v1.3.2 (2025-07-16)

  - Image preview through the kitty graphics protocol.
  - Zoxide support for path resolution in the initial configuration.
  - New 0x96f theme.

  Older entries have been trimmed. The complete upstream changelog lives at
  https://github.com/yorukot/superfile/releases
